{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>37歲崔碧珈早前捲入與58歲鄭健樂相差21載父女戀風波，近日她作客節目《九運會客室2》時終於打破沉默公開事件始 …</p><p></p>\n<p>37歲崔碧珈早前捲入與58歲鄭健樂相差21載父女戀風波，近日她作客節目《九運會客室2》時終於打破沉默公開事件始末。原來當初一張單純協助宣傳健身事業合照竟被對方利用作炒作工具，更私下聯絡媒體編造戀愛故事。面對對方屢勸不改並多次重施故技，女方最終決定採取極端手段徹底斬纜。</p>\n<h2>崔碧珈作客《九運會客室2》還原合照風波真相</h2>\n<p>崔碧珈接受伍詠薇與Brian主持訪問時重提這段緋聞，她重申當初答應合照純粹是出於同行互助心態，應男方要求協助宣傳健身事業。怎料這份善意最終被借題發揮，她直言比起委屈更多是感到憤怒，並在節目中大爆內幕指「佢就利用呢張相去做其他故仔」。她強調對方從未私下聯絡交代，反而直接找媒體講述自己編造版本，令這場相差21歲緋聞瞬間變成單方面炒作鬧劇。</p>\n<h2>女方透過公司發律師信並報警備案劃清界線</h2>\n<p>發現被利用後崔碧珈曾多次透過訊息私下交涉，她坦言當時情緒激動並發出嚴厲警告，直指「好難聽嘅說話都有喺Message白紙黑字講晒㗎喇」。然而男方依然故我未有停止炒作行為，由於私下無法解決爭端，崔碧珈最終決定透過所屬公司發出律師信。為了進一步保護自己，她更前往警署完成報案程序，以法律途徑強硬應對這場無妄之災。</p>\n<h2>鄭健樂分段式炒作緋聞令當事人對拍拖留陰影</h2>\n<p>這場風波並非單一事件，崔碧珈進一步透露對方在不同月份分開幾次反覆提及緋聞，每當她情緒稍為平復又會掀起新一波炒作。被問到日常接觸中是否不自覺給予對方錯誤信號時，她斷然否認並強調自己性格獨立猶如男人，私下外出總是戴大帽遮面及保持素顏。她堅稱自己向來公私分明，絕對不可能給予對方任何拍拖錯覺，並坦言這次事件令她對日後發展新戀情留下極大陰影。</p>\n<h2>網民湧入社交平台留言攻擊引發兩極化爭議</h2>\n<p>隨著男方反覆高調提及這段虛構關係，大量網民信以為真並湧入女方社交平台留言指責，令她無端遭受猛烈網絡圍剿。有網民留言表示「心痛Rocky哥1秒」，亦有人質疑女方處理手法過於直接。不過當真相逐漸浮出水面後，風向開始出現轉變，不少人認為男方行為構成滋擾，並留言支持女方採取法律行動保護自己。雙方事件最終透過法律程序告一段落，女方社交平台逐漸回復平靜。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179344868948964116_11489588716ae5daf206ea3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"談及與Rocky傳出的緋聞。（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179344868948964116_11489588716ae5daf206ea3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>37歲崔碧珈上節目談及與Rocky傳出的緋聞。（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179344869179768334_15019233476ae5daf410668.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Rocky反覆提及緋聞。(節目截圖)\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179344869179768334_15019233476ae5daf410668.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Rocky反覆提及緋聞。（圖片來源：《女神配對計劃2》節目截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/17657719197431940_360773233693f8a9026d9a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"崔碧珈 鄭健樂 （圖片來源：fb@Anita Chui）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/17657719197431940_360773233693f8a9026d9a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：fb@Anita Chui）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176577191670720298_1727582518693f8a8dd89ae.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"崔碧珈 鄭健樂 「大隻Rocky」單方面公開與崔碧珈戀愛關係（圖片來源：FB@Rocky Cheng ）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176577191670720298_1727582518693f8a8dd89ae.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>「大隻Rocky」單方面公開與崔碧珈戀愛關係（圖片來源：FB@Rocky Cheng ）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176587348374835201_4899549296941174be0823.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鄭健樂 崔碧珈 明顯是在暗指Rocky的一廂情願行為（圖片來源：IG@Anita Chui）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176587348374835201_4899549296941174be0823.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>明顯是在暗指Rocky的一廂情願行為（圖片來源：IG@Anita Chui）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179344869381350435_11851259566ae5daf65328c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"崔碧珈透過所屬公司高影娛樂於Threads上發布嚴正聲明。(Threads圖片)\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179344869381350435_11851259566ae5daf65328c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>崔碧珈於Threads上發布嚴正聲明。（圖片來源：Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178305500086812767_2986564676a47429953e8f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"崔碧珈 鄭健樂 （圖片來源：IG@anitachui）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178305500086812767_2986564676a47429953e8f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@anitachui）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/177581509784777940_19594194369d8c9b9f1658.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"崔碧珈 鄭健樂 （圖片來源：fb@崔碧珈 Anita Chui）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/177581509784777940_19594194369d8c9b9f1658.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：fb@崔碧珈 Anita Chui）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/177545995599595471_104326116469d35e746037c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"崔碧珈 鄭健樂 （圖片來源：IG@anitachui）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/177545995599595471_104326116469d35e746037c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@anitachui）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%b9%9d%e9%81%8b%e6%9c%83%e5%ae%a2%e5%ae%a42/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">九運會客室2</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%b4%94%e7%a2%a7%e7%8f%88/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">崔碧珈</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%84%ad%e5%81%a5%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭健樂</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3533575\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 1 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:05.056567+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1525,"images":9,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T01:10:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:56.375162+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:56.375162+00:00","content_hash":"dfdb5df44b4f9ce5be1aedfa99a879d98c4b203a3ece8f6df3344594fa44e2f1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}